## Logistics

- **Slack channel:** #people
- **Timezone:** Asia/Kolkata (IST) — always schedule and display times in IST.
- **Employee channel preference:** WhatsApp > email (same house convention as recruiting — see `packs/recruiting/config/user.md.example`), until WhatsApp Business API lands (Phase 3): the agent drafts the WhatsApp message text for a human to paste, same draft-first approval gate as email.

## Escalation contacts

- **Policy exceptions / anything outside an Approved policy doc:** Founder (until People Lead is hired).
- **HRMS access issues:** CTO (deployment/credential owner until the AI Automation Engineer joins, master PRD §5).
- **Vendor contract decisions:** Founder.

## Deletion requests (DPDP)

Any employee deletion request is honored within 7 days (master PRD §6). Route the request to {accountable human} immediately on receipt; this agent does not decide what "delete" means for HRMS/Notion records on its own — it escalates and confirms completion.
